.key FORMAT/S
.bra {
.ket }
; adb-setup: once per boot (stock kickstart, C driver on the system controller,
; SYSDISK2=bench-c.img SYSDISK2SNAP=off, TESTDISKS=bench-r.img). Loads the Rust
; dev build from DEVS:, mounts BC: (C) and BR: (Rust), formats both (FORMAT
; only on the first boot), installs AmigaDiskBench in RAM:.
FailAt 30
Copy SHARED:vscsi/adb/vscsirs.device DEVS: QUIET
Mount BC: FROM SHARED:vscsi/adb/bench.mountlist
Mount BR: FROM SHARED:vscsi/adb/bench.mountlist
If "{FORMAT}" EQ "FORMAT"
  Echo "" >RAM:cr
  SYS:System/Format <RAM:cr DRIVE BC: NAME BenchC QUICK NOICONS
  SYS:System/Format <RAM:cr DRIVE BR: NAME BenchR QUICK NOICONS
EndIf
Copy SHARED:vscsi/adb/AmigaDiskBench RAM:AmigaDiskBench ALL QUIET
Protect RAM:AmigaDiskBench/AmigaDiskBench +rwed QUIET
Info BC:
Info BR:
Echo "adb ready"
